WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.300
You're still talking to your friends?

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.180
It's complicated.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.960
When we first got together,

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.300
we were different people.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.140
*knocking on door*

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:33.920
Grampa?

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:34.540
Antony?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.980
