00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:38.680
Nice to meet you!

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.340
Morning!

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.580
Sorry, I barging on you.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.540
