00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.700
Are we in Florida?

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.500
And you...?

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:16.320
Milo Walker

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:18.400
Did I die?

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.760
And turned into some kind of a small muscular boy scout?

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:22.740
Are we dead?

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:24.940
Bethany?

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.780
No, no, no!

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.340
Bridge?

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.080
I'm the old fat dude!

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:31.640
