00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.940
Welcome to JUMANJI!

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.000
This next adventure is even more challenging.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.520
And remember: the future of JUMANJI is in your hands!

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.920
