00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.580
What the hell?

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:33.960
What the hell is this?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.480
That's your strenghts and weaknesses.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.660
Smuldering intensity?

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.240
